+/**
+ * The creator's own token (SHUI, launched by the creator and sent to the
+ * agent's wallet). SHUI keeps it: it must never sell, buy, protect, alert or
+ * simulate it — selling it would dump the creator's project in its own thin
+ * pool. Extra mints can be added with SHUI_CREATOR_TOKENS (comma-separated).
+ */
