+/**
+ * Range rebound (5b): when the 4h chart has no trend (ADX < 20 or EMAs flat),
+ * buy near the bottom of the range once the 1h RSI is low and turning up.
+ * Stop under the support, target just below the top of the range, R/R >= 1.5.
